# This project keeps environment configuration split per app, since the
# frontend and backend are deployed and run independently:
#
#   backend/.env.example   -- HF_TOKEN, model/provider settings, Cartesia/Groq/
#                              Deepgram keys, CORS origin, conversation limits.
#   frontend/.env.example  -- VITE_API_BASE_URL (the backend's public URL).
#
# Copy each to `backend/.env` and `frontend/.env` respectively and fill in
# real values. Never commit either `.env` file. See the root README.md for
# full setup instructions.
